  "fontRule": "Every font is a static TrueType (glyf) Regular, because Edit PDF embeds subsets of TrueType outlines. Noto has no static TrueType CJK font, so Han, kana and Bopomofo use Droid Sans Fallback and Hangul uses Nanum Gothic.",
